MAC0215 - Atividade Curricular em Pesquisa
==========================================

Course: https://uspdigital.usp.br/jupiterweb/obterDisciplina?nomdis=&sgldis=mac0215

Experiments
-----------

The experiments in this directory use the following repositories:

* Tree-sitter: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter
* Tree-sitter C: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-c
* Linux: https://github.com/torvalds/linux

Tree-sitter and its C grammar are used to parse and analyze C source code. The
Linux repository provides the kernel source code used by the experimental
scripts.

Directory Structure
-------------------

The repositories must be placed in the following directory structure for the
scripts to work correctly:

experiments/
├── tree-sitter/
├── tree-sitter-c/
└── linux/

